    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 <strong>Run Chicken Run!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wildest game in the chicken coop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Chicken Run</strong> is an addictive arcade game where you control a brave chicken trying to escape from insane pursuers. With simple controls, fun visuals, and a fast-paced rhythm, each round is a new chance to beat your high score \u2014 or become chicken soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful environments, unlock hilarious skins, and survive as long as you can while the chaos ramps up with every meter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Compete for the <strong>fastest escape time</strong> with our real-time <strong>leaderboard</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 <strong>Run Chicken Run!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wildest game in the chicken coop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Chicken Run</strong> is an addictive arcade game where you control a brave chicken trying to escape from insane pursuers. With simple controls, fun visuals, and a fast-paced rhythm, each round is a new chance to beat your high score \u2014 or become chicken soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful environments, unlock hilarious skins, and survive as long as you can while the chaos ramps up with every meter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Compete for the <strong>fastest escape time</strong> with our real-time <strong>leaderboard</strong></p>",
